{"c":[{"name":"20261009T193126Z-43be936f55bee97c","text":"Vanished Claude token rows stay stored: message.id and requestId were never persisted, and a user row or time gap between equal cache triples also occurs inside one response.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T014749Z-e1cebfcb88bd6cfa","text":"Cursor CLI subagents: child meta.subagentInfo has parentAgentId, toolCallId, typeName. Parent spawn is CallDynamicTool args namespace=cursor toolName=Task, not a tool named Task. CLI ingest ignores subagentInfo, so no dashboard inset.","type":"note"}]}
